      "content": "it just feels like such a lie. \"honoring him\" by pretending i'm okay when i'm not? it feels like i'm just performing for a world that doesn't even care. everything is just so heavy. sometimes i just stare at the wall and think that if i could just... not exist, or just be with him, the weight would finally stop. wouldn't it be easier if i didn't have to keep fighting this?",
